<title>UK: Second Brent cargo kept by Shell - trade.</title>
<headline>Second Brent cargo kept by Shell - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second Brent cargo to turn physical on Wednesday was kept before the five o' clock deadline by the Shell Group, traders said.</p>
<p>Earlier Phibro had kept the other June 5-7 loader, they said.</p>
<p>--Siobhan Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
